---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Heavy-Duty BLDC Drive Systems for Powered Machinery Movers"
  description="Proven BLDC geared drive systems for powered machinery movers, transport trolleys, heavy-duty AGVs and tracked carriers. 10 to 60+ ton capacity. Motor, gearbox, brake, controller — matched and tested."
  canonical="https://www.nbshzl-motor.com/heavy-duty-drives/"
>

<section class="hero-inner">
  <div class="container">
    <p class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Heavy-Duty Mobility</p>
    <h1>Heavy-Duty BLDC Drive Systems</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Motor, gearbox, brake and controller packages for battery-powered machinery movers,
      transport trolleys, AGVs and tracked carriers — from 5 to 60+ tons.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Why Equipment Manufacturers Choose SHENGHE DRIVE</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="value-card">
        <h3>Proven at Scale</h3>
        <p>Our drive systems are widely adopted by leading powered machinery mover manufacturers in China. Thousands of installations across multiple payload classes, verified in real-world heavy-load operation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h3>Complete Drive Package</h3>
        <p>Not just a motor — a matched system: BLDC motor + gearbox + electromagnetic brake + controller + encoder + wiring harness. Optimized together for your specific payload and operating conditions.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="value-card">
        <h3>Rapid Drive Selection</h3>
        <p>Share your payload, wheel diameter, speed, gradient and voltage. Our engineers recommend a configuration within 24 hours, backed by data from thousands of similar installations.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section tonnage-detail">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Drive Configurations by Payload</h2>

    <div class="payload-card">
      <div class="payload-header">
        <span class="payload-range">5–10 Tons</span>
        <span class="payload-type">Machine Skates · Light Movers</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payload-specs">
        <div><strong>Motors:</strong> 2 × 400–500W BLDC</div>
        <div><strong>Gear Ratio:</strong> 50:1</div>
        <div><strong>Voltage:</strong> 48V</div>
        <div><strong>Gearbox:</strong> 90mm L-type or R-type</div>
        <div><strong>Brake:</strong> 24V electromagnetic (optional)</div>
        <div><strong>Controller:</strong> Dual-channel, matched</div>
      </div>
      <p class="payload-note">Ideal for moving injection molds, small presses, and precision equipment in confined factory spaces. Low-profile chassis compatible.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="payload-card">
      <div class="payload-header">
        <span class="payload-range">10–20 Tons</span>
        <span class="payload-type">Transfer Trolleys · Small AGVs</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payload-specs">
        <div><strong>Motors:</strong> 2 × 750W BLDC</div>
        <div><strong>Gear Ratio:</strong> 75:1</div>
        <div><strong>Voltage:</strong> 48V</div>
        <div><strong>Gearbox:</strong> 104mm L-type, alloy gear</div>
        <div><strong>Brake:</strong> 24V electromagnetic (standard)</div>
        <div><strong>Controller:</strong> Dual-channel with ramp control</div>
      </div>
      <p class="payload-note">Most common range for factory transfer carts, CNC machine movers, and warehouse AGVs. Supports slope start up to 5°.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="payload-card payload-featured">
      <div class="payload-header">
        <span class="payload-range">20–40 Tons</span>
        <span class="payload-type">Powered Machinery Movers · Die Transfer Carts</span>
        <span class="payload-badge">Most Popular</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payload-specs">
        <div><strong>Motors:</strong> 2 × 1.5kW BLDC</div>
        <div><strong>Gear Ratio:</strong> 100:1</div>
        <div><strong>Voltage:</strong> 48V</div>
        <div><strong>Gearbox:</strong> 120mm L-type, high-torque</div>
        <div><strong>Brake:</strong> 24V electromagnetic (standard)</div>
        <div><strong>Controller:</strong> Dual-channel, current limiting, regenerative</div>
        <div><strong>Encoder:</strong> 1000 PPR incremental (optional)</div>
      </div>
      <p class="payload-note">The high-volume configuration for most powered machinery movers in the China market. Dual motor differential steering. 3-hour continuous runtime on 48V 120Ah LFP battery.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="payload-card">
      <div class="payload-header">
        <span class="payload-range">40–60+ Tons</span>
        <span class="payload-type">Heavy Movers · Ladle Carts · Tandem Systems</span>
      </div>
      <div class="payload-specs">
        <div><strong>Motors:</strong> 2 × 2kW or 2 × 3kW BLDC</div>
        <div><strong>Gear Ratio:</strong> 100:1</div>
        <div><strong>Voltage:</strong> 48–72V</div>
        <div><strong>Gearbox:</strong> 120mm L-type, reinforced</div>
        <div><strong>Brake:</strong> Dual electromagnetic + parking</div>
        <div><strong>Controller:</strong> High-current dual-channel, 150A rating</div>
        <div><strong>Tandem:</strong> Two units paired for 100–120T capacity</div>
      </div>
      <p class="payload-note">Maximum performance configuration. Supports tandem operation: two STC-60 units paired for 120-ton combined payload. Used in steel mills, heavy stamping, and foundries.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section equipment-types">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Equipment We Power</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="equip-card">
        <h3>Powered Machinery Movers</h3>
        <p>Low-profile battery-powered platforms for moving heavy machines, presses, and tooling within factories. Remote controlled, zero-turn capable.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="equip-card">
        <h3>Die & Mold Transfer Carts</h3>
        <p>Precision motorized carts for stamping dies, injection molds, and heavy castings. Turntable-equipped for 360° positioning.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="equip-card">
        <h3>Heavy-Duty AGVs</h3>
        <p>Automated guided vehicles for material handling in steel, automotive, and logistics. Dual BLDC servo drive with encoder feedback.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="equip-card">
        <h3>Battery Transport Trolleys</h3>
        <p>Trackless electric trolleys for inter-bay transfer. Self-propelled, wireless controlled, suitable for indoor and outdoor operation.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="equip-card">
        <h3>Tracked Carriers</h3>
        <p>Crawler-type carriers for rough terrain, slopes, and outdoor sites. Dual motor differential steering on rubber or steel tracks.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="equip-card">
        <h3>Electric Machine Skates</h3>
        <p>Compact motorized skates positioned under heavy loads. Multiple units work together to move oversized machinery laterally.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section cta-section">
  <div class="container cta-inner">
    <h2>Ready to Specify a Drive System?</h2>
    <p>Share your equipment parameters. Our engineers will recommend a matched drive configuration within 24 hours.</p>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="/drive-selection/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get a Drive Recommendation →</a>
      <a href="/prototype-drive-kit/" class="btn btn-outline-dark">Order a Prototype Kit</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
.hero-inner {
  background: var(--brand-dark);
  color: white;
  padding: 48px 0 56px;
}
.breadcrumb { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); margin-bottom: 16px; }
.breadcrumb a { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); text-decoration: none; }
.hero-inner h1 { font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
.hero-sub { font-size: 18px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); max-width: 640px; }

.value-card {
  background: var(--brand-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--brand-border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 28px;
}
.value-card h3 { font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px; color: var(--brand-primary); }
.value-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--brand-text-light); line-height: 1.6; }

.tonnage-detail { background: var(--brand-surface); }

.payload-card {
  background: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--brand-border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 32px;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.payload-featured { border: 2px solid var(--brand-accent); }
.payload-header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 16px; margin-bottom: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.payload-range { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--brand-primary); }
.payload-type { font-size: 15px; color: var(--brand-text-light); }
.payload-badge {
  background: var(--brand-accent);
  color: white;
  font-size: 11px;
  font-weight: 700;
  padding: 3px 10px;
  border-radius: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}
.payload-specs {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  gap: 8px 24px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.payload-specs div { font-size: 14px; padding: 4px 0; }
.payload-note { font-size: 13px; color: var(--brand-text-light); font-style: italic; border-top: 1px solid var(--brand-border); padding-top: 12px; }

.equip-card {
  background: var(--brand-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--brand-border);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 28px;
}
.equip-card h3 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px; }
.equip-card p { font-size: 14px; color: var(--brand-text-light); line-height: 1.5; }

.cta-section { background: var(--brand-primary); color: white; text-align: center; }
.cta-inner h2 { font-size: 32px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.cta-inner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); margin-bottom: 28px; font-size: 17px; }
.cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
.btn-outline-dark { background: transparent; color: white; border: 2px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4); }
.btn-outline-dark:hover { border-color: white; }
.btn-lg { padding: 16px 32px; font-size: 16px; }
</style>
